OL,3,GNEWSAChurch with hole in roof suffers
OL,4,Afunding blow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rural church that has a hole in its
OL,7,Froof is facing a #120,000 shortfall in
OL,8,Frepair funds after losing VAT relief
OL,9,Fand missing out on a grant.
OL,11,FChurches had been able to reclaim VAT
OL,12,Fon capital projects under the Listed
OL,13,FPlaces of Worship Grant Scheme but that
OL,14,Fended on 31 March.
OL,16,FIt left St Sampson's Church, near
OL,17,FCallington, in Cornwall, with a deficit
OL,18,Ffor desperately needed repairs, while
OL,19,Fits application for funding under the
OL,20,Fnew Places of Worship Renewal Fund was
OL,21,Frejected and only awarded to four
OL,22,Fchurches in the county.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
