OL,3,GNEWSAChurch with hole in roof suffers
OL,4,Afunding blow
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Culture Media and
OL,7,FSport said the fund would "prioritise
OL,8,Fheritage faith buildings in areas with
OL,9,Fthe most need, where funding can have
OL,10,Fthe greatest impact".
